export const SAVED_COMMENTS_TEXT = "Hi {{firstName}},\n\nMost creators leave the same comment under their posts: a link to a free guide, an invite to their newsletter, a booking link. Until now that meant keeping it in a notes app and pasting it in by hand, every time.\n\nCarouseLabs Engage for LinkedIn now keeps those comments for you. Save one once, and it's a click away on every post.\n\nHow it works\n\n1. Save it once\n\nOpen the Engage side panel and click New under Saved comments. Paste your comment and give it a name. Line breaks, emoji and links stay exactly as you write them.\n\n2. Engage reminds you\n\nThe first time you open one of your own posts, Engage asks if you'd like to add your usual comment, and you pick which one. It asks once per post. You choose where each comment is offered: your own posts, every post, or never.\n\n3. Insert or copy in one click\n\nClick Insert and Engage puts it in LinkedIn's comment box, or Copy it and paste it yourself. Nothing is posted until you press Post.\n\nGood to know\n\nAs many as you need\n\nKeep up to 500 saved comments on any plan. Using one never counts toward your plan's comments.\n\nKeep what Engage writes\n\nLiked a comment Engage wrote for you? Click Save under it, and it's there next time.\n\nManage them on the website\n\nAdd, edit and search them in your CarouseLabs account, and import or export a list as a CSV file.\n\nAdd your saved comments https://carouselabs.com/extension/saved\n\nDon't have Engage yet? Add CarouseLabs Engage to Chrome https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/carouselabs-engage/jgbmpekpdlckkeeffbamcbcnfodamnia, sign in with your CarouseLabs account, and your saved comments are ready on every post.\n\nThe CarouseLabs Team\n\nYou're getting this because you have a CarouseLabs account.\n\nCarouseLabs — your AI social media content studio.\n\ncarouselabs.com https://carouselabs.com · Privacy https://carouselabs.com/privacy · Terms https://carouselabs.com/terms\n\n© 2026 CarouseLabs"
